<title>HONG KONG: Cheung Kong reshuffle complete in March.</title>
<headline>Cheung Kong reshuffle complete in March.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd said on Tuesday that a reorganisation of the group, announced in January, would be completed on or about March 10.</p>
<p>Shareholders of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd and Cheung Infrastructure Holdings Ltd (CKI) approved the reorganisation plan at separate extraordinary meetings held on Monday, the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>The reorganisation involves Hutchison transferring its 35.01 percent stake in Hongkong Electric Holdings Ltd to CKI and Cheung Kong transferring its existing CKI stake to Hutchison.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
